 workflows\n- Complete documentation and examples\n- MIT License\n\nSpecialists:\n- Python FastAPI, Laravel Architect, Next.js Architect\n- React Architect, Database Engineer, Cloudflare Workers\n- TDD Engineer, Code Reviewer, GitHub CLI Agent\n- PyATS Network Engineer, OpenRouter AI, PRD Generator\n\nOrchestrators:\n- TDD: Frontend, Backend, DevOps (3 modes)\n- Design Review: Full suite of UI/UX quality automation (7 modes)\n\nDocumentation:\n- README.md with quick start\n- QUICKSTART.md for 2-minute onboarding\n- CONTRIBUTING.md with detailed guidelines\n- CHANGELOG.md tracking versions\n- Examples directory with workflow demonstrations\n\nInfrastructure:\n- .gitignore for clean repository\n- GitHub issue templates (bug, feature, new mode)\n- Pull request template\n- LICENSE (MIT)\n\n🚀 Ready for public GitHub release","tree":{"sha":"d588bca1e7a26c90f9394ecf8201c140524a4d2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ciscoittech/roo-exports/git/trees/d588bca1e7a26c90f9394ecf8201c140524a4d2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ciscoittech/roo-exports/git/commits/428d655018a7b10411110b9d901ec82d75e76838","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12874990?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ciscoittech/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ciscoittech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ciscoittech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ciscoittech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ciscoittech","id":12874990,"login":"ciscoittech","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODc0OTkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ciscoittech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ciscoittech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ciscoittech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users