ite_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandeshth148/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandeshth148/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandeshth148","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sandeshth148/fitlog-shell/commits/cc4c97809529da883cc86529979b3076f7de8a09/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-11T17:29:41Z","email":"sandeshth582@gmail.com","name":"Sandeshth148"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-11T17:29:41Z","email":"sandeshth582@gmail.com","name":"Sandeshth148"},"message":"fix: Mobile UX improvements - Show language/theme selectors, remove disabled notification bell\n\nCRITICAL FIXES:\n\n REMOVED: Disabled notification bell icon from Shell header\n   - Was commented out and confusing\n   - No clear purpose or implementation plan\n   - Cluttering the UI unnecessarily\n\n FIXED: Language and theme selectors now visible on mobile\n   - Previously hidden on screens < 768px\n   - Users couldn''t change language or theme on mobile\n   - Critical UX issue resolved\n\n CLEANED UP: Removed all notification-related code from Shell\n   - Removed notificationCount property\n   - Removed onNotificationsClick() method\n   - Removed commented HTML code\n   - Cleaner, more maintainable codebase\n\nMOBILE VIEW NOW SHOWS:\n-  Language Switcher (visible)\n-  Theme Selector (visible)\n-  User Profile (visible)\n\nNOTIFICATION ARCHITECTURE CLARIFIED:\n- Task Tracker has its own browser notifications\n- Native OS notifications (not in-app)\n- No Shell header notification system needed\n- Each MFE manages its own notifications independently","tree":{"sha":"30e659d3efbd3f74152447ca9e39c6045537b2ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sandeshth148/fitlog-shell/git/trees/30e659d3efbd3f74152447ca9e39c6045537b2ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sandeshth148/fitlog-shell/git/commits/cc4c97809529da883cc86529979b3076f7de8a09","verification"