https://api.github.com/users/Sandeshth148","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sandeshth148/fitlog-shell/commits/7b1fe9905b500c69262c4fc42b6a583b2a5d51e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-11T15:16:02Z","email":"sandeshth582@gmail.com","name":"Sandeshth148"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-11T15:16:02Z","email":"sandeshth582@gmail.com","name":"Sandeshth148"},"message":"fix: Production environment configuration for Fasting Tracker v1.1.3\n\nCRITICAL FIX: Fasting Tracker not loading in production\n\nProblem:\n- Production builds were using environment.ts (dev) instead of environment.prod.ts\n- Fasting Tracker tried to load from localhost:4206 instead of Netlify URL\n- Resulted in ERR_CONNECTION_REFUSED errors\n\nSolution:\n- Added fileReplacements to angular.json production configuration\n- Production builds now correctly replace environment.ts with environment.prod.ts\n- All MFEs now load from correct Netlify URLs in production\n\nChanges:\n- angular.json: Added fileReplacements for production config\n- package.json: Version 1.1.2 -> 1.1.3\n- version.ts: Updated to 1.1.3\n- CHANGELOG.md: Added v1.1.3 entry\n- changelog/CHANGELOG-v1.1.3.md: Detailed release notes\n\nVerified Working:\n- Fasting Tracker MFE loads correctly\n- Streaks MFE working\n- AI Insights MFE working\n- All production URLs functional","tree":{"sha":"b334557a99f9e69cd7fe954e7728d82273f45855","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sandeshth148/fitlog-shell/git/trees/b334557a99f9e69cd7fe954e7728d82273f45855"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sandeshth148/fitlog-shell/git/commits/7b1fe9905b500c69262c4fc42b6a583b2a5d51e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41871387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandeshth148/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandeshth148/follo