-11T14:52:37Z","email":"sandeshth582@gmail.com","name":"Sandeshth148"},"message":"fix: Mobile responsive fixes and PWA install prompt v1.1.1\n\nMobile Fixes:\n- Hide language and theme selectors on mobile (< 768px)\n- Keep only notifications and profile in topbar on mobile\n- Reduce spacing and padding for better mobile layout\n- Optimize logo size for small screens (28px)\n- Improve touch targets and button spacing\n\nPWA Features:\n- Add PWA install prompt component\n- Auto-show prompt 3 seconds after page load\n- Dismissal state management (7-day cooldown)\n- Slide-in animation from bottom\n- Multi-language support (English & Hindi)\n- Responsive design for all screen sizes\n\nTechnical:\n- New PwaInstallPromptComponent\n- beforeinstallprompt event integration\n- localStorage for prompt state\n- PWA translations added\n- Fixed duplicate translation keys\n\nVersion: 1.1.0 -> 1.1.1\nChangelog: changelog/CHANGELOG-v1.1.1.md","tree":{"sha":"20155f7c9288e4bd29e1c93896518f0188038a7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sandeshth148/fitlog-shell/git/trees/20155f7c9288e4bd29e1c93896518f0188038a7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Sandeshth148/fitlog-shell/git/commits/f4f862b389eb5de9fece42377093144be2f632ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41871387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandeshth148/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandeshth148/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandeshth148/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandeshth148/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sandeshth148","id":41871387,"login":"Sandeshth148","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODcxMzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandeshth148/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandeshth148/received_events","rep