-10-21T20:31:24Z","email":"gusfelix2015@gmail.com","name":"guusfelix2015"},"message":"fix: improve database startup handling and Windows compatibility\n\n- Change database wait logic to infinite retry (no timeout)\n- Increase sleep between retry attempts from 1s to 2s\n- Add initial 5s delay after Docker containers start\n- Add Windows compatibility for process cleanup (taskkill fallback)\n- Remove hard timeout limit for database readiness check\n\nThis ensures the script waits as long as needed for databases to be ready,\nespecially on slower systems or Windows environments.","tree":{"sha":"c04eb987e3072e2d3c67d55e73528412f634ebaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guusfelix2015/GSW-SENIOR-FULLSTACK-TEST/git/trees/c04eb987e3072e2d3c67d55e73528412f634ebaf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guusfelix2015/GSW-SENIOR-FULLSTACK-TEST/git/commits/26b49f0319514242453ed4f5333412510d4ee203","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54154635?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guusfelix2015/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guusfelix2015/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guusfelix2015/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guusfelix2015/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guusfelix2015","id":54154635,"login":"guusfelix2015","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MTU0NjM1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guusfelix2015/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guusfelix2015/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guusfelix2015/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guusfelix2015/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guusfelix2015/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guusfelix2015","user_view_type