-21T19:59:06Z","email":"gusfelix2015@gmail.com","name":"guusfelix2015"},"message":"feat: implement user management microservice with CRUD operations\n\n- Added User entity with properties and methods for user management.\n- Created IUserRepository interface for user repository operations.\n- Implemented UserRepository with Knex for database interactions.\n- Developed DatabaseModule for database connection configuration.\n- Created AuthController for user authentication endpoints.\n- Developed UserController for user management endpoints.\n- Implemented AuthGuard for JWT authentication.\n- Created UserMicroserviceController for handling microservice messages.\n- Added middleware for authentication token validation.\n- Developed UserModule to encapsulate user-related components.\n- Implemented integration tests for UserRepository to ensure functionality.\n- Configured TypeScript with paths for module resolution.","tree":{"sha":"8d0ebc587e0f099dc56c65cbd4c363887aac2643","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guusfelix2015/GSW-SENIOR-FULLSTACK-TEST/git/trees/8d0ebc587e0f099dc56c65cbd4c363887aac2643"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guusfelix2015/GSW-SENIOR-FULLSTACK-TEST/git/commits/4664229b40df41664d5f40d0739cb855eff3df6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54154635?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guusfelix2015/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guusfelix2015/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guusfelix2015/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guusfelix2015/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guusfelix2015","id":54154635,"login":"guusfelix2015","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MTU0NjM1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guusfelix2015/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guusfelix2015