other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomdale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tomdale","id":90888,"login":"tomdale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwODg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomdale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomdale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomdale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomdale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomdale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomdale","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/microfrontends/commits/7a743be5a77f738d4b356ce986d4ebdcf0abc943/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T15:36:17Z","email":"tom.dale@vercel.com","name":"Tom Dale"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T15:36:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(local-proxy): preserve the browser-facing origin behind the proxy (#64)\n\nThe local proxy previously presented every upstream request as though it\noriginated from http://localhost:<port>. Apps served behind a custom local\nhostname or a TLS terminator (e.g. https://web.localhost) had no way to learn\nthe URL the browser actually used, which breaks absolute URLs, canonical links,\nand auth redirects during local development.\n\nAdd an optional origin, set via `--origin` or `MFE_LOCAL_PROXY_ORIGIN`. When\nconfigured, the proxy sends it downstream as x-forwarded-proto/host/port and\nrewrites fallback redirects onto it. Header injection is additive: with no\norigin configured, inbound forwarded headers pass through unchanged, so existing\nsetups are unaffected. Redirect rewriting keeps its prior localhost fallback.","tree":{"sha":"4185551c965c593f07348d2a188059e44d68800f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/microfrontends/git/trees/4185551c965c593f07348d2a188059e44d68800f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/microfrontends/git/commits/7a743be5a77f738d4b356ce986d4ebdcf0abc943","verification":{"payload":"tree 4185551c965c593f07348d2a188059e44d68800f\nparent c541600a5dded6b892f0b7f052670f8e394eac4c\nauthor Tom Dale <tom.dale@vercel.com> 1783438577 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783438577 -0700\n\nfeat(local-proxy): preserve the browser-facing origin behind the proxy (#64)\n\nThe local proxy previously presented every upstream request as though it\noriginated from http://localhost:<port>. Apps served behind a custom local\nhostname or a TLS terminator (e.g. https://web.localhost) had no way to learn\nthe URL the browser actually used, which breaks absolute URLs, canonical links,\nand auth redirects during local development.\n\nAdd an optional origin, set via `--origin` or `MFE_LOCAL_PROXY_ORIGIN`. When\nconfigured, the proxy sends it downstream as x-forwarded-proto/host/port and\nrewrites fallback redirects onto it. Header injection is additive: with no\norigin configured, inbound forwarded headers pass through unchanged, so existing\nsetups are unaffected. Redirect rewriting keeps its prior localhost fallback.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTRzxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARZUQAHQ28F4+eQycykZFvE/i+iM/\nsZHHdkXTPxuvUEHcE5PRp5gb5IUWRXZ1TCtDv1awQhs5Z3Z+CdoeHccGVzmhFlJr\nchg6Fut7Nx79m+x8czpbKcYQrm8Fk65ZH7FpZhc6HkGLXm/xdDbFsH161XRl/Gp2\nBLG2ibGAOz9zSukuBftmYuKJN+7lANltjP37tfiIh+NiajlxScFo9DYXGO2aoIG+\nM3W+1P4/cgiPhFY6iDRvghDXlk3Jp/ILPFTgH0VjOnpVuBC8SwJgONxCgXFozpYB\nWBVYU1LwkL9UD1iLvFtQVDkJURdpFQzPxbDp57tukQrtuFtYs4FrmlcygkA8KAsJ\nldEPaGIvBTHAHJHT37BgwLKkTEONgKCWKsC8wnuAKMdvmT9Bjqnoe7+fQAAxcZvQ\nsEICCEjIadkBA/2wUQCwq0B2RK89Jo2yAh3NAGBpA2qFGX24v3s8Cb7kHakr29FV\n4mPn2R6/+DuTilHD46dYG55rEj3ozrzWaegQipJ28A4bXfQCxHznVkGOzy8C7VkQ\nUeyo9ppHaKP5aigG/UaK7mtwwQOi07YhBAXEqv4wYzUbesnHpzpUT8fnnZQINTdj\ndGD+6hBxB9y43SxBrIuGDitWAtIjRGjdHSKjwCL1YuTG5BsV9kVFIfHP7Uqp+Eos\nR1X2HqmiGIRroD3QzEB7\n=1QKw\n-----END PGP 