eived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/microfrontends/commit/0b1603036cbe40476e1d1b70813a36efeb8eaa9b","node_id":"C_kwDOQGx3X9oAKDBiMTYwMzAzNmNiZTQwNDc2ZTFkMWI3MDgxM2EzNmVmZWI4ZWFhOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/microfrontends/commit/d9589cc53c67b8846c15f0b1676cfb8cdda3f045","sha":"d9589cc53c67b8846c15f0b1676cfb8cdda3f045","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/microfrontends/commits/d9589cc53c67b8846c15f0b1676cfb8cdda3f045"}],"sha":"0b1603036cbe40476e1d1b70813a36efeb8eaa9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/microfrontends/commits/0b1603036cbe40476e1d1b70813a36efeb8eaa9b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17693193?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvnewolf/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvnewolf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvnewolf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvnewolf/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rvnewolf","id":17693193,"login":"rvnewolf","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NjkzMTkz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvnewolf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvnewolf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvnewolf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvnewolf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvnewolf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvnewolf","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/microfrontends/commits/d9589cc53c67b8846c15f0b1676cfb8cdda3f045/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T12:46:20Z","email":"17693193+runewolf7@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Chris Hahn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T12:46:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(next/client): guard prerender speculation rules against Chromium 147 crash (#53)\n\nChromium 147 ships a resurrected CHECK in MarkPrerenderMatchedWithPrefetch\nthat crashes the browser process when prerender + prefetch matching is\ninvoked more than once per URL — which happens on cross-zone MFE\nnavigations. The fix was cherry-picked into M148 (148.0.7778.43).\n\nAdds an `isPrerenderSafe()` client-side guard that detects Chromium 147\nvia the user-agent and omits the `prerender:` block from the emitted\nspeculation rules JSON. Prefetch rules are unaffected.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"1f06381d4cdbcada59f5503076b6ba831e3d0986","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/microfrontends/git/trees/1f06381d4cdbcada59f5503076b6ba831e3d0986"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/microfrontends/git/commits/d9589cc53c67b8846c15f0b1676cfb8cdda3f045","verification":{"payload":"tree 1f06381d4cdbcada59f5503076b6ba831e3d0986\nparent af86bf97b3b9eeb7dcb6bd76cad3b4bc53f43ee1\nauthor Chris Hahn <17693193+runewolf7@users.noreply.github.com> 1779194780 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779194780 +0100\n\nfix(next/client): guard prerender speculation rules against Chromium 147 crash (#53)\n\nChromium 147 ships a resurrected CHECK in MarkPrerenderMatchedWithPrefetch\nthat crashes the browser process when prerender + prefetch matching is\ninvoked more than once per URL — which happens on cross-zone MFE\nnavigations. The fix was cherry-picked into M148 (148.0.7778.43).\n\nAdds an `isPrerenderSafe()` client-side guard that detects Chromium 147\nvia the user-agent and omits the `prerender:` block from the emitted\nspeculation rules JSON. Prefetch rules are unaffected.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDFucCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5IwQACM7Bmaz52WF/XFGHOP+8BPa\n+lXnvLZgcOiNR9CRqppFViwA8Txk3xE4oud44opMIlD2M0W2QMe5DUroBQPZOIaP\nnbcfzUjwINjs7fbrglq/lioqyz9+PClIMKMV+fa7UsuoJoarxHfD9VfAyLXcJEpW\n2cqGHz0s7gVWhHthjRksTrNKRxhpUTfRafSJWefTGQQz1u6tg27qoQq1671TPwFk\nlk0R40XJzhAsTJuKWVyvYrDJs+EMSa7YGJWqu+yxRNQ1nPcrRlWJH2shLJmNq4om\nh9dnBQ4dCIbzup7uIQ9gtQq1ALNlzSqPmxx5OBvKm5Hd4d8Z5ORyt4uA5LGvVYk8\nQvkVFXfI0uNUpFlsY7Ud8tR+3QgLEGXWZvD2QXlosoVPBWQAV6fAl2/3GmBQSEE0\noVLpyqqAxqZ2Gs5rYbVKLgDKKtuMiHiupTfJKVGolLQKBrQif5o3N7xE60NOU2pd\n2mQ8vntQfOBOxVd50wkv+wMtao4faA6HwTxwJxldr34HOJj7dU/xUjBDJNpEo823\njnIVonHQF4waA7MWq6HAxNN2vevwzlhzxdFa5Tt+vQXUK/7qLnCIaH1ibeoPCe/R\n3pE7T0lnS75VQru2p/B+IcdQnji+Vf49Z3zpeb8D+NR0pON1OpE+9HRdkWv+FnUE\n6m29En8CAXF19kkPhqoS\n=tAKT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-19T12:46:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/microfrontends/commit/d9589cc53c67b8846c15f0b1676cfb8cdda3f045","node_id":"C_kwDOQGx3X9oAKGQ5NTg5Y2M1M2M2N2I4ODQ2YzE1ZjBiMTY3NmNmYjhjZGRhM2YwNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/microfrontends/commit/af86bf97b3b9eeb7dcb6bd76cad3b4bc53f43ee1","sha":"af86bf97b3b9eeb7dcb6bd76cad3b4bc53f43ee1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/microfrontends/commits/af86bf97b3b9eeb7dcb6bd76cad3b4bc53f43ee1"}],"sha":"d9589cc53c67b8846c15f0b1676cfb8cdda3f045","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/microfrontends/commits/d9589cc53c67b8846c15f0b1676cfb8cdda3f045"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18235985?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tim123abc","id":18235985,"login":"tim123abc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjM1OTg1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim123abc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/microfrontends/commits/af86bf97b3b9eeb7dcb6bd76cad3b4bc53f43ee1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T08:36:48Z","email":"18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tim White"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T08:36:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: signed commits for release workflow (#51)\n\n* ci: use GitHub API commit mode for changesets\n\nAdds `commitMode: github-api` to the changesets action so commits and\ntags are signed by GitHub, satisfying the \"Require signed commits\" rule\non `changeset-release/main`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: replace README.md and AGENTS.md symlinks with real files\n\nThe GitHub API (used by `commitMode: github-api` in changesets) does not\nsupport symlinks. Replaces both with committed real files, kept in sync\nvia the `prepare` script on `pnpm install`:\n\n- `AGENTS.md` ← copy of `CLAUDE.md`\n- `packages/microfrontends/README.md` ← copy of root `README.md`\n\n`CLAUDE.md` and root `README.md` are the sources of truth. Note added\nto `CLAUDE.md` to prevent editing the copies directly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: remove executable bits from scripts and CLI binary\n\nThe GitHub API (used by `commitMode: github-api` in the release\nworkflow) rejects executable files. Strips the executable bit from:\n\n- `scripts/local-release.js` — adds a `local-release` npm script so it\n  can still be run via `pnpm local-release`\n- `packages/microfrontends/cli/index.cjs` — the npm bin entry; pnpm sets\n  the executable bit at install time regardless\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ba4065f7cebd18a93b457a5e68d546b1b57e3f60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/microfrontends/git/trees/ba4065f7cebd18a93b457a5e68d546b1b57e3f60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/microfrontends/git/commits/af86bf97b3b9eeb7dcb6bd76cad3b4bc53f43ee1","verification":{"payload":"tree ba4065f7cebd18a93b457a5e68d546b1b57e3f60\nparent cf42d290539b58fd27f8873a3dd8b725543b5707\nauthor Tim White <18235985+tim123abc@users.noreply.github.com> 1777624608 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777624608 +0100\n\nfix: signed commits for release workflow (#51)\n\n* ci: use GitHub API commit mode for changesets\n\nAdds `commitMode: github-api` to the changesets action so commits and\ntags are signed by GitHub, satisfying the \"Require signed commits\" rule\non `changeset-release/main`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: replace README.md and AGENTS.md symlinks with real files\n\nThe GitHub API (used by `commitMode: github-api` in changesets) does not\nsupport symlinks. Replaces both with committed real files, kept in sync\nvia the `prepare` script on `pnpm install`:\n\n- `AGENTS.md` ← copy of `CLAUDE.md`\n- `packages/microfrontends/README.md` ← copy of root `README.md`\n\n`CLAUDE.md` and root `README.md` are the sources of truth. Note added\nto `CLAUDE.md` to prevent editing the copies directly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: remove executable bits from scripts and CLI binary\n\nThe GitHub API (used by `commitMode: github-api` in the release\nworkflow) rejects executable files. Strips the executable bit from:\n\n- `scripts/local-release.js` — adds a `local-release` npm script so it\n  can still be run via `pnpm local-release`\n- `packages/microfrontends/cli/index.cjs` — the npm bin entry; pnpm sets\n  the executable bit at install time regardless\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp9GYgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZ3IQAFQaqzV2JS++A1DzgqXLDUzo\nuq3/7mlOwsi8iBT+TiLpafElWjj7wRmWad7eJ1l5tXVX+q9ioad2bluCLyLSmbcw\nFlyFc60101XhgpXA02oXVQmvwZzDEZXlQaKNEL6hokQRevaLUlhH7qUReXpCr/GT\nWGI6Q+PraU3ABi/hkWb+HHhsYFF8WdFe4MTqSMehnF6yGR1rFD9uQQreyBYEoXP3\nO+kN4FxsWbHnPhpqvVvgrlcB6FXHaj6FZ5JH9FYhQ4DYiNifXXmlvI6KnBChx+Zw\npy+ORf8tx+kcClAhHQVpxfV0EqnTAIDdIkTooXTyzc+ztMMYzCn9p8+j6G8LXOIH\n/KT5PmIzFwS5fjHb3fUdosKbgQHjIiHYxo1oXwIySDrFVmaPRBqT7CllisWZGfoE\nBSrVz5p4ng/4qrWXRC9caTRz5lLWpXEXEz65CzqGUTgZluFGriWu6yGqxH5eylaM\nCzCnvnV4GEv4ACxSgH321kemT2G/OUI4bgs9oF2P