types.ts was being picked up as a leading\ncomment on the Config interface declaration by ts-morph (after bundling removes\nthe blank line between them), causing vercel/api''s OpenAPI generator to throw\n\"Expected a single JSDoc comment, but found 2\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* add patch changelog for openAPI generator fix\n\n* skill: update create-group entry with --project-route and non-interactive support\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* skill: note that --non-interactive is blocked when exceeding free tier\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* skill: rename --project-route to --project-default-route, add --yes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: remove hyphen from changeset description\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"080335962950f4902f990f81645954f6b1937d06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/microfrontends/git/trees/080335962950f4902f990f81645954f6b1937d06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/microfrontends/git/commits/9440654f52c650db7c47e1f540427406c0390146","verification":{"payload":"tree 080335962950f4902f990f81645954f6b1937d06\nparent 35b7ec0c5209ce4d76c9821e02b609b1b2aac086\nauthor Tim White <tim181510@gmail.com> 1775029587 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775029587 +0100\n\nskill: update create-group with --project-route and non-interactive support (#48)\n\n* fix: convert file-level JSDoc to regular comment in types.ts\n\nThe file-level JSDoc comment on types.ts was being picked up as a leading\ncomment on the Config interface declaration by ts-morph (after bundling removes\nthe blank line between them), causing vercel/api''s OpenAPI generator to throw\n\"Expected a single JSDoc comment, but found 2\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* add p