_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/microfrontends/commit/528ebc10814e0cee987f69ccefa790fe42320d14","node_id":"C_kwDOQGx3X9oAKDUyOGViYzEwODE0ZTBjZWU5ODdmNjljY2VmYTc5MGZlNDIzMjBkMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/microfrontends/commit/5a74aaf92a6322c77e601e48bd3cb554ca127644","sha":"5a74aaf92a6322c77e601e48bd3cb554ca127644","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/microfrontends/commits/5a74aaf92a6322c77e601e48bd3cb554ca127644"}],"sha":"528ebc10814e0cee987f69ccefa790fe42320d14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/microfrontends/commits/528ebc10814e0cee987f69ccefa790fe42320d14"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171406206?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonypan2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonypan2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonypan2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonypan2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonypan2","id":171406206,"login":"tonypan2","node_id":"U_kgDOCjdzfg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonypan2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonypan2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonypan2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonypan2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonypan2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonypan2","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/microfrontends/commits/5a74aaf92a6322c77e601e48bd3cb554ca127644/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-13T21:18:55Z","email":"tony.pan@vercel.com","name":"Tony Pan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-13T21:18:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Add environment variable overrides for local development ports (#32)\n\n* feat: Add environment variable overrides for local development ports\n\nAdd two new environment variables to enable running multiple worktrees\nsimultaneously with different ports:\n\n- MFE_PORT_OVERRIDE: Override the dev server port (default from config)\n- MFE_LOCAL_PROXY_PORT_OVERRIDE: Override the local proxy port (default 3024)\n\nThis is part of enabling parallel local development across multiple\nfront worktrees. Each worktree can set different port values via\nenvironment variables without modifying shared configuration files.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: make proxy aware of MFE_PORT_OVERRIDE for local app routing\n\nWhen MFE_PORT_OVERRIDE is set, the proxy now correctly routes to the\noverridden port instead of the config default. This fixes multi-worktree\nsetups where the app runs on a dynamic port but the proxy was still\nlooking for it on the default port (3331).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor: rename env vars per review feedback\n\nRemove _OVERRIDE suffix from environment variable names:\n- MFE_PORT_OVERRIDE -> MFE_PORT\n- MFE_LOCAL_PROXY_PORT_OVERRIDE -> MFE_LOCAL_PROXY_PORT\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor: rename MFE_PORT to MFE_APP_PORT per review feedback\n\n- Renamed env var from MFE_PORT to MFE_APP_PORT to clarify single-app usage\n- Added validation in local proxy to throw error if MFE_APP_PORT is set\n  with multiple local apps running\n- Updated changeset to document single-app limitation\n- Fixed pre-existing lint issues (parseInt radix parameter)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: change release type to patch\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"44eb89c05df2f9f38f18d10c289c6ee6cf35e2c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/microfrontends/git/trees/44eb89c05df2f9f38f18d10c289c6ee6cf35e2c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/microfrontends/git/commits/5a74aaf92a6322c77e601e48bd3cb554ca127644","verification":{"payload":"tree 44eb89c05df2f9f38f18d10c289c6ee6cf35e2c7\nparent 2f168562ba777783b60e4641e49957137baa269b\nauthor Tony Pan <tony.pan@vercel.com> 1768339135 -0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1768339135 -0800\n\nfeat: Add environment variable overrides for local development ports (#32)\n\n* feat: Add environment variable overrides for local development ports\n\nAdd two new environment variables to enable running multiple worktrees\nsimultaneously with different ports:\n\n- MFE_PORT_OVERRIDE: Override the dev server port (default from config)\n- MFE_LOCAL_PROXY_PORT_OVERRIDE: Override the local proxy port (default 3024)\n\nThis is part of enabling parallel local development across multiple\nfront worktrees. Each worktree can set different port values via\nenvironment variables without modifying shared configuration files.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: make proxy aware of MFE_PORT_OVERRIDE for local app routing\n\nWhen MFE_PORT_OVERRIDE is set, the proxy now correctly routes to the\noverridden port instead of the config default. This fixes multi-worktree\nsetups where the app runs on a dynamic port but the proxy was still\nlooking for it on the default port (3331).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor: rename env vars per review feedback\n\nRemove _OVERRIDE suffix from environment variable names:\n- MFE_PORT_OVERRIDE -> MFE_PORT\n- MFE_LOCAL_PROXY_PORT_OVERRIDE -> MFE_LOCAL_PROXY_PORT\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor: rename MFE_PORT to MFE_APP_PORT per review feedback\n\n- Renamed env var from MFE_PORT to MFE_APP_PORT to clarify single-app usage\n- Added validation in local proxy to throw error if MFE_APP_PORT is set\n  with multiple local apps running\n- Updated changeset to document single-app limitation\n- Fixed pre-existing lint issues (parseInt radix parameter)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: change release type to patch\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpZra/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIPIQABGeEv/VEd5ti4ricqaYbtlW\n0cwlbhjih9cAbnVS3K+AH8T6lo+APT3s+atIUhaKD5I/mWXiDCKhDHNyW+Fn9EVW\nRRNtmDkADrWCRqNlGU1OocLjwEWTtPkPDHvjuZg0E5mgqESPzTzmsXCxmJc6+Dov\nFCq8BD8sNjt5wm3iAEj+uR4qOqExu3GngSsb/BhLOqWeRqkHCnpk/I5cQqCCfkZy\n/jeL0KPcCQj1qoMYipCpoBnI3M4nmsG7vYflJ4u57YottLRTu1EA421iP9JQGqEp\nk7sObO1G5UMTno0z6SKrJppDLQIFlC7R074+eQZhznhqBZmvXy8NBtZC0T/3K1km\nKC1G5DlIaRqSjMHPdepd9Hw83o+c2xPo4jTW4fYhQofDoaRsPi1iOqcan2fKr9bm\nGobx+UYz5Bkiq57MGyHw5vlq/YP/hL0FT+madAtRwdAo4OOLdGtpuGOw1i5dGQQd\nx1eAXcGkxa3wFAKV5/wORA9+Qs84rTsJGcZaxfvlXLYaX9VlCrczZXKYvEAvB16S\n524QEG7QVnYP0mxSZm/EG2Vbfba+fNoJ8AbhzTJ1bC4Ub/zOp+jY+KV1XmwWA9mY\nTOyZZrRITm8S5z3D7BXlf55j1DAS86pQG0sHwb6RHCYk+6vxzQSVUsAar1Nx2WK2\nuA/ewJwY5q8YCg+NC/qo\n=BpMq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-01-13T21:18:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://a