mail-marketing-landing-page/commit/fe55d0c5f4af5992413c18a59bf5f82292e6bfdc","node_id":"C_kwDOQHI5etoAKGZlNTVkMGM1ZjRhZjU5OTI0MTNjMThhNTliZjVmODIyOTJlNmJmZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MichaelCrowe11/v0-email-marketing-landing-page/commit/5098fc78c801c198c33996f02b4b2d06560fa9ca","sha":"5098fc78c801c198c33996f02b4b2d06560fa9ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MichaelCrowe11/v0-email-marketing-landing-page/commits/5098fc78c801c198c33996f02b4b2d06560fa9ca"}],"sha":"fe55d0c5f4af5992413c18a59bf5f82292e6bfdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MichaelCrowe11/v0-email-marketing-landing-page/commits/fe55d0c5f4af5992413c18a59bf5f82292e6bfdc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MichaelCrowe11/v0-email-marketing-landing-page/commits/5098fc78c801c198c33996f02b4b2d06560fa9ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-03T12:05:52Z","email":"crowelogic@Mac.lan","name":"Michael Crowe"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-03T12:05:52Z","email":"crowelogic@Mac.lan","name":"Michael Crowe"},"message":"fix: critical launch fixes — model selector, license, Shopify, Species Library\n\n1. Replace 28-model selector with static CroweLM v1.0 badge (API ignores\n   model selection — showing fake options was misleading)\n\n2. Fix license cookie verification using EFFECTIVE_SECRET instead of raw\n   LICENSE_SECRET env var (prevents verification failures when env var\n   is not set)\n\n3. Guard Shopify integration when domain/token not configured — skip\n   API calls instead of throwing errors on every page load\n\n4. Allow unauthenticated reads on public tables (species_library,\n   contamination_library, etc.) in the Azure query route — was\n   returning 401 even for PUBLIC_READ_TABLES\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"db1ae45d683ea9a0e505b11d7c80801b9158ac39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MichaelCrowe11/v0-email-marketing-landing-page/git/trees/db1ae45d683ea9a0e505b11d7c80801b9158ac39"}