ing-page/commits/93906d720ffa6c3dcc6a6c33848e355a838f5dcc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-20T04:38:28Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-20T04:38:28Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix deployment and configuration issues\n\n## Changes Made:\n\n### 1. Environment Variables\n- Created .env.railway.example template with all required and optional variables\n- Updated .gitignore to allow .env.railway.example while protecting .env.railway\n- Added comprehensive documentation for each environment variable\n\n### 2. Package Manager Consistency\n- Updated nixpacks.toml to use pnpm instead of npm\n- Updated railway.json to use pnpm commands\n- Ensures consistent dependency management across all environments\n\n### 3. Deployment Scripts\n- Improved error handling in deploy-railway.sh\n- Improved error handling in deploy-railway.ps1\n- Added helpful messages when .env.railway is missing\n- Scripts now skip Railway template variables (e.g., ${{RAILWAY_PUBLIC_DOMAIN}})\n- Added interactive prompts for better user experience\n\n### 4. Documentation\n- Created DEPLOYMENT_FIXES_APPLIED.md with comprehensive troubleshooting guide\n- Documented all issues found and fixes applied\n- Added deployment checklist and post-deployment steps\n\n## Issues Fixed:\n- Missing environment variables template\n- npm/pnpm inconsistency causing build failures\n- Poor error messages in deployment scripts\n- No guidance for missing .env.railway file\n\nReady for production deployment with improved reliability and error handling.","tree":{"sha":"0729cc3519efef5da59bba1a1d814f6a5657cd66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MichaelCrowe11/v0-email-marketing-landing-page/git/trees/0729cc3519efef5da59bba1a1d814f6a5657cd66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MichaelCrowe11/v0-email-marketing-landing-page/git/commits/93906d720ffa6c3dcc6a6c33848e355a838f5dcc","verification":{"payload":"tree 0729cc3519efef5da59bba1a1d814f6a5657cd66\nparent 245ac7eb9f5fe9b38a7bbecdfa1cac8eb7737a66\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763613508 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1763613508 +0000\n\nFix deployment and configuration issues\n\n## Changes Made:\n\n### 1. Environment Variables\n- Created .env.railway.example template with all required and optional variables\n- Updated .gitignore to allow .env.railway.example while protecting .env.railway\n- Added comprehensive documentation for each environment variable\n\n### 2. Package Manager Consistency\n- Updated nixpacks.toml to use pnpm instead of npm\n- Updated railway.json to use pnpm commands\n- Ensures consistent dependency management across all environments\n\n### 3. Deployment Scripts\n- Improved error handling in deploy-railway.sh\n- Improved error handling in deploy-railway.ps1\n- Added helpful messages when .env.railway is missing\n- Scripts now skip Railway template variables (e.g., ${{RAILWAY_PUBLIC_DOMAIN}})\n- Added interactive prompts for better user experience\n\n### 4. Documentation\n- Created DEPLOYMENT_FIXES_APPLIED.md with comprehensive troubleshooting guide\n- Documented all issues found and fixes applied\n- Added deployment checklist and post-deployment steps\n\n## Issues Fixed:\n- Missing environment variables template\n- npm/pnpm inconsistency causing build failures\n- Poor error messages in deployment scripts\n- No guidance for missing .env.railway file\n\nReady for production deployment with improved reliability and error handling.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNUikJN4\nZxu+DqseHQa6rPFwwZMYMOY1+93DnUW3Zw05VWxBYH81h3kMjhupjAjPyyB2a415MhzBNWd9e4Hb\nhgM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-20T04:38:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","ev