om/u/83824908?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cheng-chun-yuan","id":83824908,"login":"cheng-chun-yuan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODI0OTA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/commits/904949020b26aa3848359d1f93d65bdc125e2520/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-26T08:46:33Z","email":"83824908+cheng-chun-yuan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"cheng-chun-yuan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-26T08:46:33Z","email":"83824908+cheng-chun-yuan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"cheng-chun-yuan"},"message":"feat: implement on-chain feedback via Reputation Registry contract\n\nReplace off-chain feedback API with direct smart contract interaction:\n\nOn-chain feedback system:\n- Integrate Reputation Registry smart contract ABI\n- User signs transactions via wallet (wagmi)\n- Feedback stored on Hedera blockchain\n\nSmart contract integration:\n- giveFeedback() function with 7 parameters\n- agentId: Judge''s registry ID\n- score: 0-100 (converted from 1-5 stars)\n- tag1/tag2: keccak256 hashed tags\n- feedbackUri: IPFS URI for detailed feedback\n- feedbackHash: IPFS content hash for verification\n- feedbackAuth: Agent owner signature\n\nFeedback flow:\n1. User rates judge (1-5 stars → 0-100 score)\n2. Add optional tags (max 2, converted to bytes32)\n3. Add optional comment\n4. Upload to IPFS (POST /api/upload-feedback)\n5. Get authorization from agent owner (POST /api/judges/:id/feedback-auth)\n6. Convert tags using keccak256(toHex())\n7. Call smart contract via wagmi\n8. User signs transaction in wallet\n9. Transaction confirms on-chain\n10. Show HashScan link to verify\n\nTransaction state management:\n- isPending: Waiting for wallet confirmation\n- isConfirming: Transaction confirming on-chain\n- isSuccess: Show HashScan link with tx hash\n- error: Display error message\n\nUI improvements:\n- Real-time transaction status display\n- Wallet signature prompts\n- HashScan verification links\n- Success/error state handling\n- Disabled state during transaction\n- Score conversion display (rating/5 → score/100)\n\nBackend endpoints needed:\n- POST /api/upload-feedback (IPFS upload)\n- POST /api/judges/:id/feedback-auth (get signature)\n\nEnvironment variables:\n- NEXT_PUBLIC_REPUTATION_REGISTRY_ADDRESS","tree":{"sha":"818f25e48dd81533940397709aefec9a04048290","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/git/trees/818f25e48dd81533940397709aefec9a04048290"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/git/commits/904949020b26aa3848359d1f93d65bdc125e2520","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83824908?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cheng-chun-yuan","id":83824908,"login":"cheng-chun-yuan","n