"https://github.com/cheng-chun-yuan","id":83824908,"login":"cheng-chun-yuan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODI0OTA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/commits/1a2715a509708e1fd977bad6a8ced6639406ec1b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-25T16:57:19Z","email":"83824908+cheng-chun-yuan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"cheng-chun-yuan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-25T16:57:19Z","email":"83824908+cheng-chun-yuan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"cheng-chun-yuan"},"message":"feat: integrate Hedera EVM transfers and test evaluation with HCS\n\nMajor updates to submit flow and Hedera integration:\n\n**Hedera Integration:**\n- Add Hedera EVM transfer functionality with proper account ID to EVM address conversion\n- Implement HBAR decimal conversion (10^18 wei for EVM compatibility)\n- Add manual conversion fallback for accounts without EVM addresses\n- Fix buffer allocation for shard.realm.account format conversion\n\n**Submit Flow Enhancements:**\n- Replace agent wallet creation with direct backend account funding (0.0.7125500)\n- Add wallet connection with auto-derive Hedera account from EVM address\n- Implement HBAR transfer UI with MetaMask integration\n- Add funding transaction tracking with HashScan links\n\n**Test Evaluation Updates:**\n- Update API request to match new backend format (agentIds, content, maxRounds, consensusAlgorithm)\n- Add HCS topic display with clickable HashScan link\n- Add prominent HCS topic info card with real-time viewing tip\n- Make all result fields flexible with fallbacks (averageScore, consensusScore, etc.)\n- Add round selector UI with preset buttons (1, 2, 3, 5 rounds)\n\n**Orchestrator Page:**\n- Add real-time HBAR balance fetching from Hedera testnet\n- Implement balance refresh functionality\n- Add loading states and error handling for undefined properties\n- Make all fields optional with nullish coalescing operators\n\n**Bug Fixes:**\n- Fix undefined property errors across orchestrator page\n- Handle optional fields in test results display\n- Add conditional rendering for wallet information\n- Proper error handling for missing API response fields","tree":{"sha":"f21c7f399e31e7f719aae310b1b58d6d587adc79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/git/trees/f21c7f399e31e7f719aae310b1b58d6d587adc79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/git/commits/1a2715a509708e1fd977bad6a8ced6639406ec1b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83824908?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cheng-chun-yuan","id":83824908,"login":"cheng-chun-yuan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODI0OTA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/subscriptions"