isplay scoring, discussion, and adjustment messages\n  - Step 4: Orchestrator funding and creation\n    - Budget input with minimum validation\n    - Owner address (Hedera Account ID) configuration\n    - Create orchestrator with selected judges and budget\n    - Success confirmation with system details\n\n- UI improvements:\n  - Real-time HCS message timeline display\n  - Consensus algorithm and variance metrics\n  - Judge evaluation breakdown with strengths/improvements\n  - Budget calculation showing available evaluations\n  - Loading states for orchestrator creation\n\nThis creates a verifiable, transparent judge system where all agent\ncommunications are recorded on Hedera Consensus Service for auditability.","tree":{"sha":"5e7368c1dd8ed687a7abea8c9a5ea6e259fb39c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/git/trees/5e7368c1dd8ed687a7abea8c9a5ea6e259fb39c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/git/commits/5b2a480ed22464fda3c5a9004035c93520c0efb8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83824908?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cheng-chun-yuan","id":83824908,"login":"cheng-chun-yuan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODI0OTA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://ap