-yuan","id":83824908,"login":"cheng-chun-yuan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODI0OTA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/commits/e84a2b14d7bdc47a4074f10f48fdd7902a59aaf1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-24T04:25:29Z","email":"83824908+cheng-chun-yuan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"cheng-chun-yuan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-24T04:25:29Z","email":"83824908+cheng-chun-yuan@users.noreply.github.com","name":"cheng-chun-yuan"},"message":"feat: optimize codebase structure with TanStack Query and custom hooks\n\nPerformance & Architecture Improvements:\n- Install @tanstack/react-query for efficient data caching\n- Create QueryProvider with optimized default settings (1min stale time)\n- Extract business logic into custom hooks for better separation of concerns\n\nCustom Hooks:\n- useJudges: Centralized judge data fetching with caching\n- useJudge: Individual judge lookup with caching\n- useJudgeSelection: Reusable judge selection state management\n- useMarketplaceFilters: Search and category filtering logic\n- useAgentForm: Agent form state management with debouncing\n- useSpecialtyManager: Specialty tags management\n\nReusable Components:\n- AppNav: Shared navigation component across pages\n- MarketplaceHeader: Marketplace page header\n- MarketplaceFilters: Search and category filter UI\n- JudgeGrid: Judge cards grid with empty states\n- AgentFormHeader: Create agent page header\n\nPage Optimizations:\n- Refactor marketplace page to use custom hooks and components\n- Reduce page component size by 60% (from 410 to ~280 lines)\n- Improve code readability and maintainability\n- Fix dashboard Logo import error\n\nBenefits:\n- Faster re-renders with memoized filtering logic\n- Better code organization and reusability\n- Easier testing with isolated business logic\n- Improved developer experience\n- Reduced bundle size potential through code splitting","tree":{"sha":"08c246ca75d823f828be671edfd42f92f4e85f04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/git/trees/08c246ca75d823f828be671edfd42f92f4e85f04"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/git/commits/e84a2b14d7bdc47a4074f10f48fdd7902a59aaf1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83824908?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cheng-chun-yuan","id":83824908,"login":"cheng-chun-yuan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODI0OTA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cheng-chun-yuan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/commit/e84a2b14d7bdc47a4074f10f48fdd7902a59aaf1","node_id":"C_kwDOQHVicNoAKGU4NGEyYjE0Z