d scoring\n   - Outlier detection and handling\n   - Convergence threshold monitoring\n   - Progress tracking UI component\n\nNew Components:\n\nlib/hedera/hcs-communication.ts\n- HCS topic creation and management\n- Agent message publishing and subscription\n- Topic history retrieval\n- Discussion broadcasting\n- Final consensus publication\n\nlib/hedera/consensus-algorithms.ts\n- 6 consensus algorithms with variance/confidence calculation\n- Agent weight calculation based on reputation\n- Outlier detection using z-scores\n- Convergence measurement\n- Score adjustment mechanisms\n\nlib/hedera/multi-agent-orchestrator.ts\n- Complete evaluation workflow orchestration\n- Independent scoring phase execution\n- Multi-round discussion facilitation\n- Consensus aggregation\n- HCS publishing of final results\n- Agent reputation updates\n- Judgment result generation\n\ncomponents/evaluation-progress.tsx\n- Real-time progress visualization\n- 5-stage workflow display\n- Consensus result presentation\n- Individual agent scores\n- HCS topic explorer link\n- Confidence and variance metrics\n\ntypes/agent.ts\n- OrchestratorConfig interface\n- EvaluationProgress tracking\n- ConsensusResult type\n- Enhanced type safety\n\nFeatures:\n\n✓ HCS-based secure communication\n✓ Independent parallel scoring\n✓ Multi-round discussion with adjustments\n✓ 6 consensus algorithms\n✓ Reputation-weighted aggregation\n✓ Outlier detection and handling\n✓ Convergence tracking\n✓ Time-bounded rounds\n✓ Progress visualization\n✓ Immutable audit trail on Hedera\n✓ X402 payment integration\n✓ ERC-8004 reputation updates\n\nBenefits:\n\n- Transparent: All agent communications on HCS\n- Auditable: Immutable record on Hedera blockchain\n- Flexible: Multiple consensus algorithms\n- Robust: Outlier detection and variance tracking\n- Fair: Reputation-based weighting\n- Efficient: Convergence detection stops early\n- Accountable: Agent reputations updated based on quality\n\nUpdated README with:\n- Complete 7-step evaluation process\n- Consensus algorithm comparison\n- Workflow type explanations\n- Configuration examples\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHqrcc23\ntW4QL7bd5ISk4RTcmUTjVqvyJhLuOljw12wEwSyV6gYT/c6yU5IXKnjrLOH5Y0SPGZ73flraAt1C\nEQo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-10-22T20:11:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/commit/2fc98aaf827d71870f9902ec7540e3570be106d1","node_id":"C_kwDOQHVicNoAKDJmYzk4YWFmODI3ZDcxODcwZjk5MDJlYzc1NDBlMzU3MGJlMTA2ZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/commit/ed2d4b923a8675a9159b8c358431f4f27c6c4f3d","sha":"ed2d4b923a8675a9159b8c358431f4f27c6c4f3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/commits/ed2d4b923a8675a9159b8c358431f4f27c6c4f3d"}],"sha":"