npm\n- Built-in bundler and test runner\n- Better performance for development\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"00fdf1455f30a971ef7990725e0a06f7a1111a0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/git/trees/00fdf1455f30a971ef7990725e0a06f7a1111a0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/git/commits/ed2d4b923a8675a9159b8c358431f4f27c6c4f3d","verification":{"payload":"tree 00fdf1455f30a971ef7990725e0a06f7a1111a0f\nparent 7ac9296fb68aeb49e5fac249f2bf96ea3a25258a\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1761162933 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1761162933 +0000\n\nMigrate to Bun package manager\n\nReplaced npm/pnpm with Bun for faster dependency management and build times.\n\nChanges:\n- Removed package-lock.json and pnpm-lock.yaml\n- Added bun.lock for dependency locking\n- Updated all documentation to use bun commands\n- Modified .gitignore to exclude non-bun lock files\n- Added .env.example to repository (was previously ignored)\n- Updated README.md: bun install, bun run dev, bun test, bun start\n- Updated ARCHITECTURE.md: bun install, bun run dev\n\nBenefits of Bun:\n- 20-40x faster package installation\n- Drop-in replacement for Node.js/npm\n- Built-in bundler and test runner\n- Better performance for development\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQH4Cmbyi\njROfCGvk0Utv+lLrTFbTxuJUjxPp+fAZmcNVX811BfnHdukDZHAESRF7DtOUac1bWOUOrSVD/YNk\nmgE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-10-22T19:55:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/commit/ed2d4b923a8675a9159b8c358431f4f27c6c4f3d","node_id":"C_kwDOQHVicNoAKGVkMmQ0YjkyM2E4Njc1YTkxNTliOGMzNTg0MzFmNGYyN2M2YzRmM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/commit/7ac9296fb68aeb49e5fac249f2bf96ea3a25258a","sha":"7ac9296fb68aeb49e5fac249f2bf96ea3a25258a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/commits/7ac9296fb68aeb49e5fac249f2bf96ea3a25258a"}],"sha":"ed2d4b923a8675a9159b8c358431f4f27c6c4f3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/commits/ed2d4b923a8675a9159b8c358431f4f27c6c4f3d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/commits/7ac9296fb68aeb49e5fac249f2bf96ea3a25258a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-22T19:46:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-22T19:46:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Integrate Hedera Agent Kit, X402 payments, and ERC-8004 registries\n\nTransformed Jury Box into a decentralized multi-agent platform where creators\ncan deploy custom AI judge agents with blockchain integration.\n\nKey Features:\n- Hedera Agent Kit integration for agent account management\n- X402/A2A protocol for agent-to-agent cryptocurrency payments\n- ERC-8004 registries for identity, reputation, and validation\n- Agent creation UI with full customization\n- Multi-agent workflows (parallel, sequential, hierarchical)\n- On-chain reputation and payment tracking\n\nTechnical Changes:\n- Added Hedera SDK and Agent Kit dependencies\n- Created Hedera agent service (lib/hedera/agent-service.ts)\n- Created X402 payment service (lib/x402/payment-service.ts)\n- Created ERC-8004 registry service (lib/erc8004/registry-service.ts)\n- Added comprehensive TypeScript types (types/agent.ts)\n- Built agent creation page (app/create-agent/page.tsx)\n- Updated marketplace with \"Create Agent\" link\n- Created ARCHITECTURE.md with detailed technical docs\n- Updated README with comprehensive platform documentation\n\nArchitecture:\n- Each agent has dedicated Hedera account for payments\n- X402 protocol enables autonomous agent payments in HBAR\n- ERC-8004 provides trustless identity and reputation system\n- Agents discoverable cross-chain via registry system\n- Payment proofs enrich reputation signals\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"afbf1235c45c7a11f8631fdf6d5d20441b57133f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/git/trees/afbf1235c45c7a11f8631fdf6d5d20441b57133f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheng-chun-yuan/jurybox/git/commits/7ac9296fb68aeb49e5fac249f2bf96ea3a25258a","verification":{"payload":"tree afbf1235c45c7a11f8631fdf6d5d20441b57133f\nparent 24c6086a9e3e2c1e82e6a26743030451b5a3f07b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1761162398 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1761162398 +0000\n\nIntegrate Hedera Agent Kit, X402 payments, and ERC-8004 registries\n\nTransformed Jury Box into a decentralized multi-agent platform where creators\ncan deploy custom AI judge agents with blockchain integration.\n\nKey Features:\n- Hedera Agent Kit integration for agent account management\n- X402/A2A protocol for agent-to-agent cryptocurrency payments\n- ERC-8004 registries for identity, reputation, and validation\n- Agent creation UI with full customization\n- Multi-agent workflows (parallel, sequential, hierarchical)\n- On-chain reputation and payment tracking\n\nTechnical Changes:\n- Added Hedera SDK and Agent Kit dependencies\n- Created Hedera agent service (lib/hedera/agent-service.ts)\n- Created X402 payment service (lib/x402/payment-service.ts)\n- Created ERC-8004 registry service (lib/erc8004/registry-service.ts)\n- Added comprehensive TypeScript types (types/agent.ts)\n- Built agent creation page (app/create-agent/page.tsx)\n- Updated marketplace with \"Create Agent\" link\n- Created ARCHITECTURE.md with detailed technical docs\n- Updated README with comprehensive platform documentation\n\nArchitecture:\n- Each agent has dedicated Hedera account for payments\n- X402 protocol enables autonomous agent payments in HBAR\n- ERC-8004 provides trus